OL,3,A'No place for violence,' Macron says,
OL,4,Aas protesters clash with police in
OL,5,Acities across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench MP Clemence Guette, from the
OL,8,Fleft-wing party La France Insoumise,
OL,9,Fsays the government's response
OL,10,F"provokes" the protesters and "makes
OL,11,Fthe situation degenerate"
OL,13,FIt follows three weeks of student-led
OL,14,Fprotests across the country, with calls
OL,15,Ffor workers' unions and key figures
OL,16,Ffrom the "yellow vest" movement to join
OL,17,Fthe students
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
